Package: libkscreen
Version: @DEB_LIBKSCREEN_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://invent.kde.org/plasma/libkscreen
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-wayland, libwayland0, plasma-wayland-protocols
Description: KDE screen management library for Xios
 libkscreen provides the KF6Screen library, KScreen backends, backend launcher,
 the kscreen-doctor CLI, and DPMS helper used by KDE display settings. This
 Xios build keeps the Wayland/QScreen/fake backends and disables the Linux
 XRandR/DPMS path on iOS.
